  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Are they, then, some sort of anti-Novakid? A Yang to their Yin? The Shadow to their Light? I theorize that there are perhaps more things that predate all known life beyond just the Cultivator. Perhaps even a mate! Could such a thing be possible? Is there, somewhere among the stars, a female counterpart to the Cultivator?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "では、彼らはある種の抗ノバキドなのでしょうか? 陰の陽? 光への影? 私はおそらく、栽培者以外の既知の生活に先立つ多くのものが存在すると理論付けています。 おそらく仲間ですら! そんなことは可能でしょうか。 どこかの星の中で、培養器に匹敵する女性はいますか?"
