  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "It would certainly make their notion of Mother more credible. Most think their Hive-like mental link is nothing more than a psionic connection that goes beyond all we know...but what if they are wrong and they are in fact communing with (or are pieces of) some massive and ancient power? Some sort of being that gave rise to all of the Darkness, while the Cultivator gave rise to Light?"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "きっと、母親という概念はもっと信頼できるものになるだろう。 大半の人は、彼らの集合意識のような精神的つながりを、我々の理解を超えた超能力的な結び付きにすぎないと考えている。だが、それが誤りで、実際には巨大で古い何らかの力と交信している、あるいはその力の一部なのだとしたら？ 栽培者が光を発生させる間、暗闇のすべてを生じさせた何らかの存在?"
